  nodes:
  - id: start
    speakerID: laurent
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    text: "Ah, a visitor! And a living one, no less. Forgive me, ma ch\xE8re, I'd
      offer you a glass\u2026\r\nbut I haven't been able to hold one in fifty years."
    nextNodeID: 
    choices:
    - text: I'm here about Vivienne Encore.
      nextNodeID: 1
      addFlags: []
      requiredFlags: []
      requiredReputation: 0
      reputationChange: 0
      onSelectedEvent: {fileID: 0}
      endsDialogue: 0
    - text: I'll come back later
      nextNodeID: 
      addFlags: []
      requiredFlags: []
      requiredReputation: 0
      reputationChange: 0
      onSelectedEvent: {fileID: 0}
      endsDialogue: 1
    requiredFlags: []
    onEnterFlags: []
    onEnterEvents: []
    allowsEvidencePresentation: 0
    evidenceOptions: []
    wrongEvidenceNodeID: 
    wrongEvidenceFeedback: 
    expression: 0
  - id: 1
    speakerID: laurent
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    text: "Vivienne\u2026 Now there was a vintage. Bold on the first note, unforgettable
      on the last.\r\nThey don't bottle voices like hers anymore."
    nextNodeID: 2
    choices: []
    requiredFlags: []
    onEnterFlags: []
    onEnterEvents: []
    allowsEvidencePresentation: 0
    evidenceOptions: []
    wrongEvidenceNodeID: 
    wrongEvidenceFeedback: 
    expression: 0
  - id: 2
    speakerID: lyra
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    text: She called you her lover.
    nextNodeID: 
    choices: []
    requiredFlags: []
    onEnterFlags: []
    onEnterEvents: []
    allowsEvidencePresentation: 0
    evidenceOptions: []
    wrongEvidenceNodeID: 
    wrongEvidenceFeedback: 
    expression: 0
  - id: 3
    speakerID: 
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    text: "Did she? Ma ch\xE8re, half of Paris claimed to love her, and she let them.\r\nA
      fine wine never asks who's drinking it."
    nextNodeID: 4
    choices: []
    requiredFlags: []
    onEnterFlags: []
    onEnterEvents: []
    allowsEvidencePresentation: 0
    evidenceOptions: []
    wrongEvidenceNodeID: 
    wrongEvidenceFeedback: 
    expression: 0
  - id: 4
    speakerID: lyra
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    text: Where were you during the intermission?
    nextNodeID: 5
    choices: []
    requiredFlags: []
    onEnterFlags: []
    onEnterEvents: []
    allowsEvidencePresentation: 0
    evidenceOptions: []
    wrongEvidenceNodeID: 
    wrongEvidenceFeedback: 
    expression: 0
  - id: 5
    speakerID: laurent
    testimony: {fileID: 11400000, guid: cca978fd0271823438891c08d9e8b73d, type: 2}
    text: 'In the ballroom, of course. Ten minutes of champagne and small talk with
      some dreadfully dull duchess.

      I never set foot outside it.'
    nextNodeID: 6
    choices: []
    requiredFlags: []
    onEnterFlags: []
    onEnterEvents: []
    allowsEvidencePresentation: 0
    evidenceOptions: []
    wrongEvidenceNodeID: 
    wrongEvidenceFeedback: 
    expression: 0
  - id: 6
    speakerID: laurent
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    text: "You look unconvinced. Do you have proof? Without it, ma ch\xE8re, an accusation
      is just\u2026 vinegar."
    nextNodeID: 6
    choices:
    - text: I'll come back later
      nextNodeID: 
      addFlags: []
      requiredFlags: []
      requiredReputation: 0
      reputationChange: 0
      onSelectedEvent: {fileID: 0}
      endsDialogue: 1
    requiredFlags: []
    onEnterFlags: []
    onEnterEvents: []
    allowsEvidencePresentation: 1
    evidenceOptions:
    - item: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 628bfc80ed75e2545a80669a56ba5dca, type: 2}
      nextNodeID: b1
      addFlags: []
      onSelectedEvent: {fileID: 0}
    - item: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 555bda5e7edefa0459fcf08cf8e66864, type: 2}
      nextNodeID: t1
      addFlags: []
      onSelectedEvent: {fileID: 0}
    - item: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b53b2caef91578c41856a773a83ab023, type: 2}
      nextNodeID: v1
      addFlags: []
      onSelectedEvent: {fileID: 0}
    - item: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ca30fc7c17d189c4d89c473fb3b18292, type: 2}
      nextNodeID: r1
      addFlags: []
      onSelectedEvent: {fileID: 0}
    wrongEvidenceNodeID: 
    wrongEvidenceFeedback: Laurent swirls an empty glass, unimpressed.
    expression: 0
  - id: b1
    speakerID: laurent
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    text: "Waker's Wark\u2026 from my private reserve. There was only one bottle,
      and I only ever gave it to one person."
    nextNodeID: c1
    choices: []
    requiredFlags: []
    onEnterFlags: []
    onEnterEvents: []
    allowsEvidencePresentation: 0
    evidenceOptions: []
    wrongEvidenceNodeID: 
    wrongEvidenceFeedback: Laurent swirls an empty glass, unimpressed.
    expression: 0
  - id: t1
    speakerID: laurent
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    text: "That maid. Desir\xE9e never could look away from anything that concerned
      her lady."
    nextNodeID: c1
    choices: []
    requiredFlags: []
    onEnterFlags: []
    onEnterEvents: []
    allowsEvidencePresentation: 0
    evidenceOptions: []
    wrongEvidenceNodeID: 
    wrongEvidenceFeedback: Laurent swirls an empty glass, unimpressed.
    expression: 0
  - id: v1
    speakerID: laurent
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    text: "She\u2026 remembers the toast? After all these years.\r\nOf course she
      does. She never forgot anything that flattered her."
    nextNodeID: c1
    choices: []
    requiredFlags: []
    onEnterFlags: []
    onEnterEvents: []
    allowsEvidencePresentation: 0
    evidenceOptions: []
    wrongEvidenceNodeID: 
    wrongEvidenceFeedback: Laurent swirls an empty glass, unimpressed.
    expression: 0
  - id: r1
    speakerID: laurent
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    text: "Put that away. \u2026She hated that portrait, you know. Said the painter
      got her left side wrong.\r\nIt changes nothing."
    nextNodeID: 6
    choices: []
    requiredFlags: []
    onEnterFlags: []
    onEnterEvents: []
    allowsEvidencePresentation: 0
    evidenceOptions: []
    wrongEvidenceNodeID: 
    wrongEvidenceFeedback: Laurent swirls an empty glass, unimpressed.
    expression: 0
  - id: c1
    speakerID: laurent
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    text: "\u2026Fine. No more games."
    nextNodeID: c2
    choices: []
    requiredFlags: []
    onEnterFlags: []
    onEnterEvents: []
    allowsEvidencePresentation: 0
    evidenceOptions: []
    wrongEvidenceNodeID: 
    wrongEvidenceFeedback: Laurent swirls an empty glass, unimpressed.
    expression: 0
  - id: c2
    speakerID: laurent
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    text: 'I was with her in her dressing room. I brought the rum, like before every
      performance.

      We drank a toast to the last song.'
    nextNodeID: c3
    choices: []
    requiredFlags: []
    onEnterFlags: []
    onEnterEvents: []
    allowsEvidencePresentation: 0
    evidenceOptions: []
    wrongEvidenceNodeID: 
    wrongEvidenceFeedback: Laurent swirls an empty glass, unimpressed.
    expression: 0
  - id: c3
    speakerID: laurent
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    text: She was terrified that night. She drank too fast. She hadn't eaten since
      morning.
    nextNodeID: c4
    choices: []
    requiredFlags: []
    onEnterFlags: []
    onEnterEvents: []
    allowsEvidencePresentation: 0
    evidenceOptions: []
    wrongEvidenceNodeID: 
    wrongEvidenceFeedback: Laurent swirls an empty glass, unimpressed.
    expression: 0
  - id: c4
    speakerID: laurent
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    text: I left before the intermission ended. No one could see us leave that room
      together.
    nextNodeID: c5
    choices: []
    requiredFlags: []
    onEnterFlags: []
    onEnterEvents: []
    allowsEvidencePresentation: 0
    evidenceOptions: []
    wrongEvidenceNodeID: 
    wrongEvidenceFeedback: Laurent swirls an empty glass, unimpressed.
    expression: 0
  - id: c5
    speakerID: laurent
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    text: 'When she didn''t come back on stage, I went looking for her. I found her
      on the floor.

      She couldn''t breathe.'
    nextNodeID: c6
    choices: []
    requiredFlags: []
    onEnterFlags: []
    onEnterEvents: []
    allowsEvidencePresentation: 0
    evidenceOptions: []
    wrongEvidenceNodeID: 
    wrongEvidenceFeedback: Laurent swirls an empty glass, unimpressed.
    expression: 0
  - id: c6
    speakerID: laurent
    testimony: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7b7cc17f5e9834f45ac46ee8145a490c, type: 2}
    text: "I tried to save her. I held her, begged her to breathe\u2026\r\nHer breath
      was sweet. Strawberries. I thought it was her perfume."
    nextNodeID: c7
    choices: []
    requiredFlags: []
    onEnterFlags: []
    onEnterEvents: []
    allowsEvidencePresentation: 0
    evidenceOptions: []
    wrongEvidenceNodeID: 
    wrongEvidenceFeedback: Laurent swirls an empty glass, unimpressed.
    expression: 0
  - id: c7
    speakerID: laurent
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    text: 'Fifty years believing my rum killed her. I suppose that''s why I''m still
      here.

      Waiting for the bill.'
    nextNodeID: c8
    choices: []
    requiredFlags: []
    onEnterFlags: []
    onEnterEvents: []
    allowsEvidencePresentation: 0
    evidenceOptions: []
    wrongEvidenceNodeID: 
    wrongEvidenceFeedback: Laurent swirls an empty glass, unimpressed.
    expression: 0
  - id: c8
    speakerID: lyra
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    text: Rum doesn't smell of strawberries, Laurent.
    nextNodeID: 
    choices: []
    requiredFlags: []
    onEnterFlags:
